msgid "abilityTooltip/description/_105mm_AP_DM13_grinch"
msgstr ""
"The pinnacle of origami engineering, this rapid-fire machine gun unleashes a"
" volley of paper spikes. Its penetration isn't the highest, but the sheer "
"volume of paper is impressive! Highly accurate at first, the gun gradually "
"loses precision the longer it fires."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/_105mm_OFL_105_D1504_grinch"
msgstr ""
"A flawlessly folded magazine gun that fires slow yet armor-piercing rounds. "
"Crafted with origami-like precision, it will help you shred your enemies "
"with style."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/_152mm_AP_T_grinch"
msgstr ""
"A carefully constructed standard paper gun equipped with a very slow but "
"highly destructive explosive ball. It delivers devastating damage to help "
"you eliminate your enemies with both power and elegance, even if you miss."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchBlizzard"
msgstr ""
"Creates an area-attack snowstorm within a %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(radius)s "
"m%(ffaf5e_Close)s radius around your vehicle. The effect causes damage each "
"second and freezes enemies for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(debuffDuration)s "
"s%(ffaf5e_Close)s. Frozen targets cannot move or use abilities."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchDart"
msgstr ""
"Fires an armor-bypassing ball of glue at the targeted position. The glue "
"causes a small amount of damage over time and disables all the target's "
"abilities for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s s%(ffaf5e_Close)s. Glue can be "
"fired from stealth without revealing your position, making it particularly "
"useful against enemies using Rage."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchFlare"
msgstr ""
"Marks all targets within a %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(radius)s m "
"radius%(ffaf5e_Close)s for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s s%(ffaf5e_Close)s. "
"Marked targets receive increased damage, remain constantly spotted to all "
"other teams, and are more frequently engaged by bots."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchHeal"
msgstr ""
"Heals and inspires all allies within a %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(radius)s m "
"radius%(ffaf5e_Close)s around your vehicle for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s "
"s%(ffaf5e_Close)s. Inspired allies reload faster and have higher movement "
"speed."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchJump"
msgstr ""
"When you need a burst of power to escape a tough spot or dive into the heat "
"of battle, your vehicle makes a quick jump in the direction of the camera "
"without losing speed."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchMissiles"
msgstr ""
"Fires a guided missile that deals massive damage and follows the target "
"until it loses track or hits an obstacle. Missiles must be locked on for "
"%(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s s%(ffaf5e_Close)s before they can be fired."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchRage"
msgstr ""
"For %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s s%(ffaf5e_Close)s your vehicle will have "
"improved reload speed, turret traverse, and engine power, but it will also "
"receive damage each second. Your vehicle cannot be destroyed while the "
"ability is active."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchRam"
msgstr ""
"Activates a rocket boost for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s s%(ffaf5e_Close)s, "
"reducing ramming damage taken and disrupting guided missile tracking."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchRepairkit"
msgstr ""
"When your finely crafted paper tank takes a hit, it's Patch Tape to the "
"rescue: this handy tool repairs tracks and modules while restoring a small "
"amount of HP to keep you in the fight."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchSonar"
msgstr ""
"Sends out a scan around the targeted position. Enemies in the area receive a"
" small amount of damage and are marked for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s "
"s%(ffaf5e_Close)s. Marked targets receive increased damage, remain "
"constantly spotted to all other teams, and are more frequently engaged by "
"bots."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchStealth"
msgstr ""
"After a short delay, you disappear for %(ffaf5e_Open)s%(duration)s "
"s%(ffaf5e_Close)s in a cloud of confetti and cannot be actively spotted. The"
" effect is canceled upon shooting, taking damage, or being marked. The first"
" shot out of stealth deals bonus damage."

msgid "abilityTooltip/description/builtinGrinchTurret"
msgstr ""
"Deploys a turret that spots and engages enemies independently. You can carry"
" up to two in your vehicle, and have up to two on the map at once. When you "
"place a third, the oldest turret is destroyed."

